GET    /api/v1/automations/history             ΓåÆ ListHistory (all automations' execution history)
GET    /api/v1/automations/history/{historyId} ΓåÆ GetHistoryDetail (with FSM transitions)

GET    /api/v1/automations/{id}                ΓåÆ Get (single automation with computed fields)
